    <item>
      <title>Books</title>
      <link>/books/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/books/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;currently-reading&#34;&gt;Currently Reading&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Cover&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Info&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/otomatik_mus.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Otomatik Musteri&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Otomatik Musteri&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; John Warrillow&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/blink.png&#34; alt=&#34;Blink&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blink&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Malcolm Gladwell&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/muthis_psikoloji.png&#34; alt=&#34;Hayir Diyebilme Sanati&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hayir Diyebilme Sanati&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Muthis Psikoloji&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Ornekleri cok uzun buldugum bos zamaniniz varsa ve tek alternatifiniz bu kitapsa okunabilir. Eger sonlarina dogru beni sasirtmazsa suan icin 5 uzerinden 2 veriyorum.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/modern_c.png&#34; alt=&#34;Modern C&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern C&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Jens Gustedt&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;want-to-read&#34;&gt;Want to Read&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Cover&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Info&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/art_of_comp_prog.png&#34; alt=&#34;The Art of Computer Programming&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;The Art of Computer Programming - &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/Computer-Programming-Volumes-1-4A-Boxed/dp/0321751043&#34;&gt;Amazon Link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;HPO.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/raytracing.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Ray Tracing in One Weekend&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Ray Tracing in One Weekend (Ray Tracing Minibooks Book 1) - &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B01B5AODD8/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;amp;camp=1789&amp;amp;creative=9325&amp;amp;creativeASIN=B01B5AODD8&amp;amp;linkCode=as2&amp;amp;tag=inonwe09-20&amp;amp;linkId=OPNJXXJY2IBCMEGE&#34;&gt;Amazon Link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Details of basic ray tracing code architecture and C++ classes are given.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/the_rust_prog_lang.png&#34; alt=&#34;Rust Lang&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;The Rust Programming Language (Covers Rust 2018) - &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/Rust-Programming-Language-Covers-2018/dp/1718500440/ref=sr_1_1?dchild=1&amp;amp;keywords=rust+programming&amp;amp;qid=1590875043&amp;amp;sr=8-1&#34;&gt;Amazon Link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Uzun zamandir erteledigim ve okumak istedigim bir kitap. Rust ile bazi oyuncak programlar yazsam da hands-on hale gelemedim. Bu kitap ile bunu asacagima inaniyorum. Sirasinin gelmesini sabirsizlikla bekliyorum.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/go_prog_lang.png&#34; alt=&#34;Go Lang&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Go Programming Language, The (Addison-Wesley Professional Computing Series) 1st Edition - &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/Programming-Language-Addison-Wesley-Professional-Computing/dp/0134190440/ref=pd_sbs_14_1/138-3554675-5271064?_encoding=UTF8&amp;amp;pd_rd_i=0134190440&amp;amp;pd_rd_r=abf12a93-5f32-4cf1-97e5-a6306531aa5a&amp;amp;pd_rd_w=cQro9&amp;amp;pd_rd_wg=Sb0XS&amp;amp;pf_rd_p=12b8d3e2-e203-4b23-a8bc-68a7d2806477&amp;amp;pf_rd_r=7QQ22XK9SM7CC164T87K&amp;amp;psc=1&amp;amp;refRID=7QQ22XK9SM7CC164T87K&#34;&gt;Amazon Link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Onceliklendiremedigim guzide bas ucu kitaplarindan biri. Profesyonel olarak go programlama yapan kisilerin onerilerinin arasinda mutlaka bu kitap bulunuyor.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;read&#34;&gt;Read&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Cover&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Info&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/modvim.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The Node Beginner Book&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Node Beginner Book&lt;/strong&gt; A comprehensive Node.js Tutorial &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Manuel Kiessling  &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; ✪✪✪✪✪&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/modvim.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Modern Vim&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Vim&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Drew Neil  &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; ✪✪✪✪✪&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;This is a well-organized guide to explore Vim capabilities and tailor your editing experience with the vim scripting language and plugins. Learn your editor for better code/typing.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/kolay_ekonomi.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Kolay Ekonomi&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kolay Ekonomi&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Mahfi Egilmez  &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; ✪✪✪✪&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Kitap vaadettiginden fazlasi degil. En basit orneklerle ekonomi haberlerini takip edebileceginiz kadarini size cok sade bir uslupla veriyor. Daha once ekonomi ile ilgili hic kitap okumayanlar icin guzel.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/baslangic.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Baslangic&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baslangic&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Dan Brown &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; ✪✪✪✪&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Cevremdeki kisilerin tavsiyeleri uzerine okumaya basladigim bu kitap uzun bir sure kendini cok iyi okuttu. Konusu, akiciligi ve dili bekledigimden iyi olsa da sonu beni sasirtamadi. Fazla beklentiye girmeden bir sans vermenizi tavsiye ederim.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/irade_terbiyesi.png&#34; alt=&#34;Irade Terbiyesi&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Irade Terbiyesi&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Jules Payet &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; ✪✪✪✪✪&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Kesinlikle okunmasi gereken bir kitap. Eger 20&amp;rsquo;li yaslarimin basinda okusaydim cok daha fazla faydalanabilirdim.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/books/yansima.png&#34; alt=&#34;Yansima&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yansima&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; Muhammet Baki Ayranci  &lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; ✪✪✪&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Hic yorulmadan bir cirpida okudugum benim icin cok degerli bir dostumun eseri. Konusuyla ve tarziyla hayal gucumu gelistirdigini soyleyebilirim.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;!--links--&gt;</description>
    </item>
